    "body": "The RDO icon failure came from the wrong Femga directory family: INVENTORY_ITEMS_MP was sent to a path that returned an HTML 404. It now uses ui_textures_mp/inventory_items_mp, including Harrietum. Icon buttons show a throbber while checked, enable only after a real image decodes, and otherwise show a disabled broken-image symbol without opening an empty dialog.",
